  "notes": "Released as a single text-only 70B instruction-tuned model; no dedicated announcement post was found on ai.meta.com, and Meta's December 19, 2024 year-end blog post mentions the release. Release date: the model cards say December 6, 2024; the llama-models README table says 12/04/2024 (kept as an alternative). The GitHub model card's opening line speaks of a pretrained and instruction-tuned 70B model, but Meta's Llama 3.3 docs page says only an instruction-tuned version is provided and Meta's Hugging Face organisation lists only Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct. Llama 3.3 8B was announced at LlamaCon on 2025-04-29 for fine-tuning in the Llama API preview; no public Meta repository for its weights was found on Hugging Face. Supported languages per the model card: English, German, French, Italian, Portuguese, Hindi, Spanish and Thai."
